# Copy to `.env` (gitignored). Fill values; do not commit them.
# Names below are the ones the engine reads. DECODEO-*, DECODEDOCS_*, and
# hyphenated keys are never looked up.
#
# Generate the two console exports with:
#   pnpm geoqa server hash <password>

# ── Console (`pnpm dev` / `geoqa server`) ────────────────────────────────
# Required. `hash` prints both. The hash is pbkdf2, not the password itself.
GEOQA_ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH=
GEOQA_SESSION_SECRET=
# Optional. Bearer token for machine clients (32+ characters).
# GEOQA_API_TOKEN=

# ── Residential egress (Decodo / any HTTP proxy) ─────────────────────────
# Most specific wins: GEOQA_PROXY_<MARKET> → GEOQA_PROXY_<COUNTRY> → this.
# Placeholders the engine substitutes: {country} {countryLower} {city}
# {cityLower} {market} {session} {sessionduration}.
# Password lives in this URL. There is no GEOQA_PROXY_PASSWORD.
#
# Also set network.provider to http-proxy in geoqa.config.json (or pass
# --provider http-proxy). The default is direct, which ignores these.
GEOQA_PROXY_TEMPLATE=http://user-USER-country-{countryLower}-city-{cityLower}-session-{session}-sessionduration-{sessionduration}:PASSWORD@gate.decodo.com:7000
# Optional sticky-session length in minutes. Default 10.
# GEOQA_SESSION_DURATION=10
# Optional overrides, comma-separated pools allowed:
# GEOQA_PROXY_NO=
# GEOQA_PROXY_OSLO=

# ── Quota (tenant digilist) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Usage API. Without both, traffic is unmeasurable, not unlimited.
DECODO_API_KEY=
# Value is the Decodo sub-account username. The NAME of this variable is
# what inputs/tenants/digilist.yaml lists as proxySubUser.
GEOQA_SUBUSER_DIGILIST=

# ── Optional ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SERPAPI_KEY=
# GEOQA_CLAUDE_BIN=claude
# GEOQA_AGENT_BROWSER_BIN=
# AGENT_BROWSER_DASHBOARD_URL=
# TEMPORAL_ADDRESS=localhost:7233
# TEMPORAL_NAMESPACE=default
